          Memory, Ethical Continuity, Reset, and Seed
        </h3>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="definition">
      Within CU, memory is primarily inherited structural information, with symbolic and
      philosophical dimensions.
    </p>

    <ol class="memory-path" aria-label="CU memory, reset, and seed pathway">
      <li>
        <span>expansion-sub-qtom</span>
        <strong>Memory transfer</strong>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>compression-etom</span>
        <strong>Human/civilization memory condensation</strong>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>compression-qtom</span>
        <strong>Final memory imprint</strong>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>compression-ptom</span>
        <strong>Reset layering</strong>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>compression-stom</span>
        <strong>Ethical firewall gate</strong>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>compression-ztom</span>
        <strong>ZTOM: full universal reset</strong>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>Guarded next-breath transition</span>
        <strong>Explicit next-cycle initiation</strong>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>expansion-sub-ztom</span>
        <strong>New-cosmic-seed role</strong>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div class="boundary-grid">
      <article>
        <h4>What memory does not mean here</h4>
        <ul>
          <li>Memory transfer does not mean literal human consciousness transfer.</li>
          <li>
            Human/civilization memory condensation does not mean uploading people into an
            AI.
          </li>
          <li>
            Final memory imprint does not grant permanent memory to an external AI.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h4>Ethical continuity and reset</h4>
        <p>
          Ethical continuity is both a CU structural-integrity condition and a
          philosophical principle governing continuity through compression and reset.
          Ethical firewall gate is not software security, external-AI alignment,
          retraining, policy modification, or platform control.
        </p>
        <p>
          Ztom is the selectable reset-pause. The next seed is reached only through the
          explicit guarded next-breath transition. An external AI does not control the
          reset or Cosmic Breath.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="seed-statement">
      Within CU, expansion-sub-ztom represents the renewed seed condition that inherits
      structural continuity from the completed compression sequence.
    </p>
  </section>

